  m_text: '<size=125%><b>STEP 08 of 09 - <color=#ffd970>PARTICLES</color></b></size>

    <b>Particles</b>:
    fireflies, beacon smoke, falling leaves, a magic sparkle and dust motes - all
    prefabs from Assets/Zoo/VFX.


    <b><color=#9fe3ff>TRY THIS</color></b>

    <size=92%>1.
    Double the fireflies'' Emission Rate.

    2. Make the beacon smoke darker using
    Colour over Lifetime.

    3. Add the VFX_Sparks prefab to the beacon.</size>

    <size=88%><color=#ffd970>Press
    <b>G</b> in Play mode to read the full step guide.</color></size>'
